u prefer the worldly life,","j":30,"h":60,"s":87,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"87:17","t":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring.","j":30,"h":60,"s":87,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"87:18","t":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures,","j":30,"h":60,"s":87,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"87:19","t":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses.","j":30,"h":60,"s":87,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"88:1","t":"Has there reached you the report of the Overwhelming [event]?","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"88:2","t":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be humbled,","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"88:3","t":"Working [hard] and exhausted.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"88:4","t":"They will [enter to] burn in an intensely hot Fire.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"88:5","t":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"88:6","t":"For them there will be no food except from a poisonous, thorny plant","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"88:7","t":"Which neither nourishes nor avails against hunger.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"88:8","t":"[Other] faces, that Day, will show pleasure.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"88:9","t":"With their effort [they are] satisfied","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"88:10","t":"In an elevated garden,","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"88:11","t":"Wherein they will hear no unsuitable speech.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"88:12","t":"Within it is a flowing spring.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"88:13","t":"Within it are couches raised high","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"88:14","t":"And cups put in place","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"88:15","t":"And cushions lined up","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"88:16","t":"And carpets spread around.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"88:17","t":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created?","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"88:18","t":"And at the sky - how it is raised?","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"88:19","t":"And at the mountains - how they are erected?","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"88:20","t":"And at the earth - how it is spread out?","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"88:21","t":"So remind, [O Muḥammad]; you are only a reminder.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"88:22","t":"You are not over them a controller.","j":30,"h":60,"s":88,"a":22,"sd":null}],"juz":30,"hizb":60,"surahs":[87,88],"sajdah":false}